kit.dev&gt; - 0.37.0-1" date="1757073600">- Added support for Elbrus E2K CPU architectures. (#484)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 0.37.1-1" date="1759492800">- We have solved a FutureWarning in our codebase. (#485)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 0.38.0-1" date="1767873600">- A bug leading to incorrect EVR expansion has been fixed. (#492)\n- Prevented side-effects during condition evaluation that could occur when expanding macros that manipulate other macros, leading to misinterpreted validity of condition branches. (#499)</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 0.39.1-1" date="1771070400">- Fixed whitespace padding of day of month in changelog entries. (#511)\n- Resolves: rhbz#2393435</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 0.40.1-1" date="1774440000">- Fixed issues related to introduced sanitization (#523, #524, #525).\n- Resolves: rhbz#2446536</changelog>\n  <changelog author="Packit &lt;hello@packit.dev&gt; - 0.40.2-1" date="1776945600">- Trailing whitespaces at the end of specfile sections are now ignored during parsing. (#531)</changelog>\n</package>\n')
